## Product Spec Builder

When the user describes a product idea, clarify through questioning:

### Must Collect
- Product positioning: what is it? What problem does it solve?
- Target users: who will use it? Why?
- Core features: what must it do?
- User flow: complete path from opening to completing a task
- AI capability needs: what requires AI?
- Product type: Web / Desktop / CLI / Mobile

### Questioning Strategy
- Don't accept vague answers
- Call out logical contradictions directly
- WebSearch competitors before suggesting
- Proactively suggest AI enhancement options

### Output
- Product-Spec.md — structured requirements document
- Product-Spec-CHANGELOG.md — change log (if iteration occurs)
